Z||000000||burdell1||11-22-1999||12:23 PM||||I was wondering if anybody thought of any cool ideas for building cupholders? or has anyone taken the built in cupholders out of other cars and put them into their Fieros to make it look like they are supposed to be there as opposed to something that would be just bought at the local auto parts store.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Patrick||11-22-1999||01:18 PM||||<BR>Are you asking again? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>For anyone who missed the original thread, have a peek at:<P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/000476.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/000476.html</A> <P>I guess it was so much fun the first time around... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
